 "notes": [
  "Piel has a third attested sense beyond the two requested: Exod.27.3 (\"לְדַשְּׁנוֹ\", pots \"to receive its ashes\") and Num.4.13 (\"וְדִשְּׁנוּ\", \"they shall clear the ashes from the altar\") are the lexicon's own listed cultic sense \"to remove (fat) ashes (of sacrifices)\", distinct from \"make fat\" (Ps.23.5, Prov.15.30) and \"find acceptable\" (Ps.20.4, \"accept thy burnt sacrifice\"). Included.",
  "Requested stem \"Hothpael\" is tagged by OSHB as hothpaal (stem letter 'u'), not hothpael -- shipped as hothpaal, the standard typo-adjacent rare-stem substitution."
